ating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13832\",\"name\":\"Lionsgate UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Good Fortune\",\"synopsis\":\"In GOOD FORTUNE, a well-meaning but rather inept angel named Gabriel (Keanu Reeves) meddles in the lives of a struggling gig worker (Aziz Ansari) and a wealthy venture capitalist (Seth Rogen).\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0a/f0/0af0d58a46ef84582eeaa237c0d44111.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/4ce57d8198ca2d72766b293630976530.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/77fe3a9e42f0649ef6865ac019b89efb.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3333dcec3f6bd9f9d4b0459f1cf9139a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Good Fortune\",\"synopsis\":\"In GOOD FORTUNE, a well-meaning but rather inept angel named Gabriel (Keanu Reeves) meddles in the lives of a struggling gig worker (Aziz Ansari) and a wealthy venture capitalist (Seth Rogen).\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Aziz Ansari\",\"Seth Rogen\",\"Keanu Reeves\",\"Sandra Oh\",\"Keke Palmer\",\"Stephen McKinley Henderson\",\"Blanca Araceli\",\"Joe Mande\",\"Aditya Geddada\",\"Alexander Jo\"],\"direction\":[\"Aziz Ansari\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3333dcec3f6bd9f9d4b0459f1cf9139a.jpg\",\"img/7b/c5/7bc54295385abf264255b8e4298afc30.jpg\",\"img/fe/c2/fec2b59b27d0201e51619ba5a714a08b.jpg\",\"img/b2/56/b2567aa9cc8a8ee2d835c1a999ccbf5b.jpg\",\"img/a9/3b/a93b563de63a09eca5ed05ddefda94da.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3333dcec3f6bd9f9d4b0459f1cf9139a.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/4ce57d8198ca2d72766b293630976530.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-10-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong language, drug misuse\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Lionsgate UK\"}},{\"id\":\"1000030971\",\"title\":\"Grand Discoveries 2.0: Frontiers of Applied AI in Medicine\",\"runtime\":10800,\"genres\":\"\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ddf01c8ea779dbb64d40d123a0fcab92.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"400693\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"directors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"embargoes\":[],\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-09-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"24287\",\"name\":\"Independent\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Grand Discoveries 2.0: Frontiers of Applied AI in Medicine\",\"synopsis\":null,\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ddf01c8ea779dbb64d40d123a0fcab92.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Frontiers of Applied AI in Medicine will focus on the real use cases, beyond the hype, that are emerging for AI in healthcare - and also discuss the expectations for AI that haven’t proven true.\\n\\nThe panellist will share their lived experience of using AI at the intersection of Pharma, Biotech startups, and foundational models; how the investment landscape is changing and adapting with AI; and ultimately, where AI is giving us the chance to future-proof and change the way we look at disease moving forward.\\n\\nFeaturing voices across the board in med-tech:\\n\\nDr. Margarete Fabre, MBChB MRCP FRCPath PhD – Oncology Therapy Area Lead, Centre for Genomics Research, AstraZeneca & Honorary Consultant Haematologist, Cambridge University Hospitals\\n\\nNicole Lai - Healthcare Investor, Legal & General\\n\\nDawn McCollough - President, AI Precision Medicine Centre of Excellence, Bakersfield. Founder McCollough Consulting.\\n\\nEmil Hewage - CEO & Founder of BIOS Health & Managing Director at Cambridge Applied Research (Host)\\n\\nExpect a thought-provoking evening of bold ideas, cross-sector insight, and dynamic discussion.\\n\\n7.00pm - Arrivals, food & drinks reception and networking \\n8.00pm - Panel begins \\n9.15pm - Panel ends and networking in the lounge\\n10.00pm - Event ends\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7fd0cc940a84e397ef14215d3719930a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Grand Discoveries 2.0: Frontiers of Applied AI in Medicine\",\"synopsis\":\"Frontiers of Applied AI in Medicine will focus on the real use cases, beyond the hype, that are emerging for AI in healthcare - and also discuss the expectations for AI that haven’t proven true.\\n\\nThe panellist will share their lived experience of using AI at the intersection of Pharma, Biotech startups, and foundational models; how the investment landscape is changing and adapting with AI; and ultimately, where AI is giving us the chance to future-proof and change the way we look at disease moving forward.\\n\\nFeaturing voices across the board in med-tech:\\n\\nDr. Margarete Fabre, MBChB MRCP FRCPath PhD – Oncology Therapy Area Lead, Centre for Genomics Research, AstraZeneca & Honorary Consultant Haematologist, Cambridge University Hospitals\\n\\nNicole Lai - Healthcare Investor, Legal & General\\n\\nDawn McCollough - President, AI Precision Medicine Centre of Excellence, Bakersfield. Founder McCollough Consulting.\\n\\nEmil Hewage - CEO & Founder of BIOS Health & Managing Director at Cambridge Applied Research (Host)\\n\\nExpect a thought-provoking evening of bold ideas, cross-sector insight, and dynamic discussion.\\n\\n7.00pm - Arrivals, food & drinks reception and networking \\n8.00pm - Panel begins \\n9.15pm - Panel ends and networking in the lounge\\n10.00pm - Event ends\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7fd0cc940a84e397ef14215d3719930a.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7fd0cc940a84e397ef14215d3719930a.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-09-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Independent\"}},{\"id\":\"1000007239\",\"title\":\"Grand Prix of Europe\",\"runtime\":5880,\"genres\":\"Animation, Family, Adventure\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"369606\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"img/21/c1/21c1cca41bd4a9ed1157f5a10d3f1285.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6a/73/6a73f0414bcc6616503950fd33669e6f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/50/13/5013851cc83d46f4d65e0ee14442eb52.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/22/34/2234d77727d04d24c0e950f28b4225fe.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e4/e9/e4e97709f1ab3a7ed9063f57d88539d6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/81/7e/817ed7725b01003b1104f7935a9b8737.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6a/8c/6a8c8da9af79ecc602281b209d0114e3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d0/71/d071997f361fb9f3bb3384669e134e79.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/06/98/0698182517c5e2c57f16e65192e4306c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/02/a3/02a34ac4af0bc43252a3b77b3f9f499a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b8/4d/b84d3c8b94a222cacda4a4e9511d13d9.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Waldemar\",\"lastName\":\"Fast\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Gemma\",\"lastName\":\"Arterton\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Thomas\",\"lastName\":\"Brodie-Sangster\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Hayley\",\"lastName\":\"Atwell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lenny\",\"lastName\":\"Henry\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rob\",\"lastName\":\"Beckett\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Colin\",\"lastName\":\"McFarlane\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"David\",\"lastName\":\"Menkin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ayesha\",\"lastName\":\"Antoine\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Guillaume\",\"lastName\":\"Laroche\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Joseph\",\"lastName\":\"Balderrama\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-08-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"very mild threat, rude humour, language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000120048\",\"name\":\"Kazoo Films\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Grand Prix of Europe\",\"synopsis\":\"Edda, a young mouse with big dreams of becoming a race car driver, lives in the vibrant world of a fairground operated by her father, Erwin. As the 50th anniversary of the European Grand Prix approaches, Edda sees a golden opportunity to turn her dreams into reality and save her father's struggling business. When she meets her racing idol at the grand event, Edda is inspired to take a daring step. With determination and courage, she decides to get behind the wheel herself, racing against time and destiny to make her mark and bring hope to her family's livelihood.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/369606_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/369606_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/21/c1/21c1cca41bd4a9ed1157f5a10d3f1285.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/ce616eb44dd2a35b59f3373510aeac91.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Grand Prix Of Europe\",\"synopsis\":\"Edda, a young mouse with big dreams of becoming a race car driver, lives in the vibrant world of a fairground operated by her father, Erwin. As the 50th anniversary of the European Grand Prix approaches, Edda sees a golden opportunity to turn her dreams into reality and save her father's struggling business. When she meets her racing idol at the grand event, Edda is inspired to take a daring step. With determination and courage, she decides to get behind the wheel herself, racing against time and destiny to make her mark and bring hope to her family's livelihood.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[\"Gemma Arterton\",\"Thomas Brodie-Sangster\",\"Hayley Atwell\",\"Lenny Henry\",\"Rob Beckett\",\"Colin McFarlane\",\"David Menkin\",\"Ayesha Antoine\",\"Guillaume Laroche\",\"Joseph Balderrama\"],\"direction\":[\"Waldemar Fast\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"img/6a/73/6a73f0414bcc6616503950fd33669e6f.jpg\",\"img/50/13/5013851cc83d46f4d65e0ee14442eb52.jpg\",\"img/22/34/2234d77727d04d24c0e950f28b4225fe.jpg\",\"img/e4/e9/e4e97709f1ab3a7ed9063f57d88539d6.jpg\",\"img/81/7e/817ed7725b01003b1104f7935a9b8737.jpg\",\"img/6a/8c/6a8c8da9af79ecc602281b209d0114e3.jpg\",\"img/d0/71/d071997f361fb9f3bb3384669e134e79.jpg\",\"img/06/98/0698182517c5e2c57f16e65192e4306c.jpg\",\"img/02/a3/02a34ac4af0bc43252a3b77b3f9f499a.jpg\",\"img/b8/4d/b84d3c8b94a222cacda4a4e9511d13d9.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/ce616eb44dd2a35b59f3373510aeac91.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-08-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"very mild threat, rude humour, language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/369606_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/369606_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Kazoo Films\"}},{\"id\":\"1000029483\",\"title\":\"Hamilton (10th Anniversary)\",\"runtime\":9660,\"genres\":\"Musical\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"398788\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a39c29f75832e1861f4c06ad7e541176.jpg\",\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Thomas\",\"lastName\":\"Kail\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"moderate bad language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Hamilton (10th Anniversary)\",\"synopsis\":\"The filmed version of the original Broadway smash hit HAMILTON combines the best elements of live theater, film and streaming in an astounding blend of hip-hop, jazz, R&B and Broadway. Presenting the tale of American founding father Alexander Hamilton, this revolutionary moment in theater is the story of America then, told by America now.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/16/82/16822b646c505fedf277f0e1a8afa3c9.png\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/38587530539f1734ed7ad46b2151caa5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a39c29f75832e1861f4c06ad7e541176.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"See it on the big screen! Join us at Everyman as we celebrate 10 years of the Broadway phenomenon, Hamilton.\\n\\nThe filmed version of the original smash-hit production captures the magic of live theatre with the cinematic power of film and streaming. Featuring an unforgettable score that fuses hip-hop, jazz, R&B and Broadway, Hamilton tells the story of American founding father Alexander Hamilton, a revolutionary tale of America then, brought to life by America now.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/679a0fb0b6ce7a2d3c9f96ebde2dc1c9.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Hamilton (10th Anniversary)\",\"synopsis\":\"See it on the big screen! Join us at Everyman as we celebrate 10 years of the Broadway phenomenon, Hamilton.\\n\\nThe filmed version of the original smash-hit production captures the magic of live theatre with the cinematic power of film and streaming. Featuring an unforgettable score that fuses hip-hop, jazz, R&B and Broadway, Hamilton tells the story of American founding father Alexander Hamilton, a revolutionary tale of America then, brought to life by America now.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Thomas Kail\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/679a0fb0b6ce7a2d3c9f96ebde2dc1c9.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/679a0fb0b6ce7a2d3c9f96ebde2dc1c9.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/38587530539f1734ed7ad46b2151caa5.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"moderate bad language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Walt Disney\"}},{\"id\":\"326625\",\"title\":\"Highest 2 Lowest\",\"runtime\":7980,\"genres\":\"Drama, Thriller\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"360566\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/08632b443cf78affabed32fb9fd