2 Lowest\",\"synopsis\":\"When a titan music mogul (Denzel Washington), widely known as having the “best ears in the business”, is targeted with a ransom plot, he is jammed up in a life-or-death moral dilemma. Brothers Denzel Washington and Spike Lee reunite for the 5th in their long working relationship for a reinterpretation of the great filmmaker Akira Kurosawa’s crime thriller High and Low, now played out on the mean streets of modern day New York City.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Denzel Washington\",\"Jeffrey Wright\",\"Ilfenesh Hadera\",\"ASAP Rocky\",\"Ice Spice\",\"Dean Winters\",\"Michael Potts\",\"LaChanze\",\"Jeremy Sample\",\"Evyn George\"],\"direction\":[\"Spike Lee\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/87a551dc00e120df9f25409c5258a729.jpg\",\"img/28/2a/282afde9fe85bb7be52fa0c53899d71d.jpg\",\"img/1d/99/1d99f4995b3eecfcb2dd6ddf84d12400.jpg\",\"img/fc/f2/fcf2d4b89af44ba5f7d7be66b56e45f4.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/87a551dc00e120df9f25409c5258a729.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/d5edfe7c6a99edb8b8aa92f68916d246.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-08-29T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong language, brief drug misuse\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"A24\"}},{\"id\":\"305413\",\"title\":\"Him\",\"runtime\":5760,\"genres\":\"Horror\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"363134\",\"388382\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/42057ae2414de0fe346584b0926dc5a2.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d3/b4/d3b4cd5afac15376e62ee08327f3e299.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0d/42/0d42104de87624ca32db4fb414821e96.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c7/fd/c7fd6ed680e42ce36ece2ae6400a549c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/76/9d/769ddfe9154f0084846aafa553ce6812.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c6/e3/c6e345d46f82f9ba758ac805115a44cd.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Justin\",\"lastName\":\"Tipping\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tyriq\",\"lastName\":\"Withers\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marlon\",\"lastName\":\"Wayans\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Julia\",\"lastName\":\"Fox\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tim\",\"lastName\":\"Heidecker\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jim\",\"lastName\":\"Jefferies\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Guapdad\",\"lastName\":\"4000\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Esodie\",\"lastName\":\"Geiger\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Indira G.\",\"lastName\":\"Wilson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Don\",\"lastName\":\"Benjamin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kiara\",\"lastName\":\"Gomez\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-10-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong bloody violence, injury detail\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"18\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"26962\",\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Him\",\"synopsis\":\"From Oscar® winner Jordan Peele and Monkeypaw Productions, producers of the landmark horror films Get Out, Us, Candyman and Nope, comes a blood-chilling journey into the inner sanctum of fame, power and the pursuit of excellence at any cost. From an acclaimed Black List screenplay by Zack Akers & Skip Bronkie (creators of the sci-fi crime series Limetown), HIM centers on a promising young football player, invited to train at the isolated compound of a dynasty team's aging QB1. Marlon Wayans stars in an electrifying dramatic role as the legendary quarterback, and former college athlete Tyriq Withers (The Game, Tell Me Lies) plays his protégé.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b2/c7/b2c7969217224ae4990261e9b793aa41.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/5d79ddfb540fd747df237549c63468fc.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/42057ae2414de0fe346584b0926dc5a2.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"From Oscar® winner Jordan Peele and Monkeypaw Productions, producers of the landmark horror films Get Out, Us, Candyman and Nope, comes a blood-chilling journey into the inner sanctum of fame, power and the pursuit of excellence at any cost.\\n\\nFrom an acclaimed Black List screenplay by Zack Akers & Skip Bronkie (creators of the sci-fi crime series Limetown), HIM centers on a promising young football player, invited to train at the isolated compound of a dynasty team’s aging QB1.\\n\\nMarlon Wayans stars in an electrifying dramatic role as the legendary quarterback, and former college athlete Tyriq Withers (I Know What You Did Last Summer, Atlanta) plays his protégé. The film also stars Julia Fox (Uncut Gems, No Sudden Move), Tim Heidecker (First Time Female Director, Us), comedian Jim Jefferies (The Jim Jefferies Show), and hip hop phenoms Guapdad 4000 and Grammy nominee Tierra Whack, both in their feature film debuts.\\n\\nHIM is directed by Justin Tipping (Kicks, Joe vs. Carole) and is produced by Ian Cooper (Nope, Us), Jordan Peele (Nope, Get Out), Win Rosenfeld (Candyman, Lovecraft Country) and Jamal M. Watson (Hala, Sprinter) for Monkeypaw Productions and is executive produced by David Kern (The Bikeriders, Flamin' Hot) and Monkeypaw's Kate Oh.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5b09460f86594561c3146b071b5991ea.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Him\",\"synopsis\":\"From Oscar® winner Jordan Peele and Monkeypaw Productions, producers of the landmark horror films Get Out, Us, Candyman and Nope, comes a blood-chilling journey into the inner sanctum of fame, power and the pursuit of excellence at any cost.\\n\\nFrom an acclaimed Black List screenplay by Zack Akers & Skip Bronkie (creators of the sci-fi crime series Limetown), HIM centers on a promising young football player, invited to train at the isolated compound of a dynasty team’s aging QB1.\\n\\nMarlon Wayans stars in an electrifying dramatic role as the legendary quarterback, and former college athlete Tyriq Withers (I Know What You Did Last Summer, Atlanta) plays his protégé. The film also stars Julia Fox (Uncut Gems, No Sudden Move), Tim Heidecker (First Time Female Director, Us), comedian Jim Jefferies (The Jim Jefferies Show), and hip hop phenoms Guapdad 4000 and Grammy nominee Tierra Whack, both in their feature film debuts.\\n\\nHIM is directed by Justin Tipping (Kicks, Joe vs. Carole) and is produced by Ian Cooper (Nope, Us), Jordan Peele (Nope, Get Out), Win Rosenfeld (Candyman, Lovecraft Country) and Jamal M. Watson (Hala, Sprinter) for Monkeypaw Productions and is executive produced by David Kern (The Bikeriders, Flamin' Hot) and Monkeypaw's Kate Oh.\",\"certificate\":\"18\",\"casting\":[\"Tyriq Withers\",\"Marlon Wayans\",\"Julia Fox\",\"Tim Heidecker\",\"Jim Jefferies\",\"Guapdad 4000\",\"Esodie Geiger\",\"Indira G. Wilson\",\"Don Benjamin\",\"Kiara Gomez\"],\"direction\":[\"Justin Tipping\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5b09460f86594561c3146b071b5991ea.jpg\",\"img/d3/b4/d3b4cd5afac15376e62ee08327f3e299.jpg\",\"img/0d/42/0d42104de87624ca32db4fb414821e96.jpg\",\"img/c7/fd/c7fd6ed680e42ce36ece2ae6400a549c.jpg\",\"img/76/9d/769ddfe9154f0084846aafa553ce6812.jpg\",\"img/c6/e3/c6e345d46f82f9ba758ac805115a44cd.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5b09460f86594561c3146b071b5991ea.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/5d79ddfb540fd747df237549c63468fc.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-10-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong bloody violence, injury detail\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\"}},{\"id\":\"1000030539\",\"title\":\"Honey Don’t\",\"runtime\":5340,\"genres\":\"Comedy, Detective\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"400204\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e1c37b3b304d680c862086ba66ad7366.jpg\",\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Ethan\",\"lastName\":\"Coen\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Margaret\",\"lastName\":\"Qualley\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Aubrey\",\"lastName\":\"Plaza\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lera\",\"lastName\":\"Abova\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Chris\",\"lastName\":\"Evans\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":null,\"lastName\":\"Jacnier\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-09-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong sex, sex references, violence, injury detail, very strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13733\",\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Beyond: Honey Don’t\",\"synopsis\":\"HONEY DON’T! is a dark comedy about Honey O’Donahue, a small-town private investigator, who delves into a series of strange deaths tied to a mysterious church.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c1/97/c197db765be6eedaf00699b4190b39f6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAs