:\"LFF Preview: Frankenstein\",\"synopsis\":\"Oscar-winning director Guillermo del Toro adapts Mary Shelley's classic tale of Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist who brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/43/f4/43f426cc0678ca77f6b0aeda910f56e3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1689c9e32f35659cae393122a69d9594.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a special preview of Frankenstein, as part of the London Film Festival 2025.\\n\\nOscar-winning director Guillermo del Toro adapts Mary Shelley's classic tale of Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist who brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/543f007df7d016f3323c397443a4e1f0.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"LFF Preview: Frankenstein\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a special preview of Frankenstein, as part of the London Film Festival 2025.\\n\\nOscar-winning director Guillermo del Toro adapts Mary Shelley's classic tale of Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist who brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Oscar Isaac\",\"Jacob Elordi\",\"Mia Goth\"],\"direction\":[\"Guillermo del Toro\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/543f007df7d016f3323c397443a4e1f0.jpg\"],\"he