}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"LFF Preview: Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/17c255ce6b5a084e1e2c37468ce1b0f9.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a special preview of Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery, as part of the London Film Festival 2025.\\n\\nBenoit Blanc (Daniel Craig) returns for his most dangerous case yet in the third and darkest chapter of Rian Johnson’s murder mystery opus. Starring Daniel Craig, Josh O’Connor, Glenn Close, Josh Brolin, Mila Kunis, Jeremy Renner, Kerry Washington, Andrew Scott, Cailee Spaeny, Daryl McCormack, and Thomas Haden Church.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/de3bc27b3c863077e0f96cf07ccfc4ae.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"LFF Preview: Wake Up Dead Man\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a special preview of Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery, as part of the London Film Festival 2025.\\n\\nBenoit Blanc (Daniel Craig) returns for his most dangerous case yet in the third and darkest chapter of Rian Johnson’s murder mystery opus. Starring Daniel Craig, Josh O’Connor, Glenn Close, Josh Brolin, Mila Kunis, Jeremy Renner, Kerry Washington, Andrew Scott, Cailee Spaeny, Daryl McCormack, and Thomas Haden Church.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Daniel Craig\",\"Josh O'Connor\",\"Cailee Spaeny\"],\"direction\":[\"Rian Johnson\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/de3bc27b3c863077e0f96cf07ccfc4ae.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/de3bc27b3c863077e0f96cf07ccfc4ae.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-10-08T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"229490\",\"title\":\"La La Land\",\"runtime\":7680,\"genres\":\"Musical, Romance\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"209869\",\"243