":\"Infiniti\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"D.W.\",\"lastName\":\"Moffett\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Paul\",\"lastName\":\"Grimstad\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"James\",\"lastName\":\"Raterman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Starletta\",\"lastName\":\"DuPois\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"embargoes\":[],\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong language, sex references, violence, references to sexual violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13759\",\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"One Battle After Another\",\"synopsis\":\"Washed-up revolutionary Bob (DiCaprio) exists in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited, self-reliant daughter, Willa (Infiniti).  When his evil nemesis (Penn) resurfaces after 16 years and she goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her, father and daughter both battling the consequences of his past.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/372340_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/372340_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4e/a0/4ea09925e3ecebbf056642378f14ee8f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/d73264679f9d595629f98d5b45147563.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/06708b1f461d7eea4d8b47a2a6acadb7.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Bob (Leonardo DiCaprio) is a washed-up revolutionary who lives in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited and self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces and Willa goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her as both father and daughter battle the consequences of their pasts.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/852d283a4f2dbb3e8dc2ff2a34f57475.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"One Battle After Another\",\"synopsis\":\"Bob (Leonardo DiCaprio) is a washed-up revolutionary who lives in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited and self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces and Willa goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her as both father and daughter battle the consequences of their pasts.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Leonardo DiCaprio\",\"Benicio Del Toro\",\"Teyana Taylor\",\"Sean Penn\",\"Regina Hall\",\"Chase Infiniti\",\"D.W. Moffett\",\"Paul Grimstad\",\"James Raterman\",\"Starletta DuPois\"],\"direction\":[\"Paul Thomas Anderson\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/852d283a4f2dbb3e8dc2ff2a34f57475.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/852d283a4f2dbb3e8dc2ff2a34f57475.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/d73264679f9d595629f98d5b45147563.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong language, sex references, violence, references to sexual violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/372340_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/372340_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"}},{\"id\":\"2072\",\"title\":\"One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest\",\"runtime\":7740,\"genres\":\"Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5808c35db39ce35e7d2073085f0d38ff.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"6111\"],\"quadImages\":[],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/14/02/26/13/47/055754.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889063.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889062.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889061.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889060.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889059.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889058.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889057.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889056.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889055.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jack\",\"lastName\":\"Nicholson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Louise\",\"lastName\":\"Fletcher\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"William\",\"lastName\":\"Redfield\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Brad\",\"lastName\":\"Dourif\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Will\",\"lastName\":\"Sampson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Lloyd\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Danny\",\"lastName\":\"DeVito\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dean R.\",\"lastName\":\"Brooks\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Peter\",\"lastName\":\"Brocco\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Michael\",\"lastName\":\"Berryman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Milos\",\"lastName\":\"Forman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2017-04-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"9597\",\"name\":\"BFI Distribution\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest\",\"synopsis\":\"\",\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5808c35db39ce35e7d2073085f0d38ff.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Selected by the Casting Directors Branch, Everyman presents: One Flew Over The Cuckoo's Nest.\\n\\nWhen free-spirited petty crook Randle P. McMurphy (Jack Nicholson) arrives at the state mental hospital, his contagious sense of disorder jolts the routine. He's on one side of a brewing war, soft-spoken, coolly monstrous Nurse Ratched (Louis Fletcher) on the other. At stake is the fate of every patient in the ward.\\n\\nJack Nicholson won his first Oscar for his vibrant portrayal of the rebellious R. P. McMurphy in director Milos Forman’s Best Picture-winning film version of Ken Kesey’s popular novel set in a mental institution. Casting directors Mike Fenton and Jane Feinberg helped fill the screen with an impressively vivid ensemble, including Best Actress winner Louise Fletcher, Supporting Actor nominee Brad Dourif, Christopher Lloyd, Danny DeVito, Scatman Crothers, and Will Sampson. \\n\\nRestored in 2025 by the Academy Film Archive, with restoration funding provided by Teatro Della Pace Film and special thanks to Paul Zaentz, the feature returns to the big screen in 4k at Everyman The Whiteley on Thursday, 9 October.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1e66a7a39c5d3850a388942f873385c4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest\",\"synopsis\":\"Selected by the Casting Directors Branch, Everyman presents: One Flew Over The Cuckoo's Nest.\\n\\nWhen free-spirited petty crook Randle P. McMurphy (Jack Nicholson) arrives at the state mental hospital, his contagious sense of disorder jolts the routine. He's on one side of a brewing war, soft-spoken, coolly monstrous Nurse Ratched (Louis Fletcher) on the other. At stake is the fate of every patient in the ward.\\n\\nJack Nicholson won his first Oscar for his vibrant portrayal of the rebellious R. P. McMurphy in director Milos Forman’s Best Picture-winning film version of Ken Kesey’s popular novel set in a mental institution. Casting directors Mike Fenton and Jane Feinberg helped fill the screen with an impressively vivid ensemble, including Best Actress winner Louise Fletcher, Supporting Actor nominee Brad Dourif, Christopher Lloyd, Danny DeVito, Scatman Crothers, and Will Sampson. \\n\\nRestored in 2025 by the Academy Film Archive, with restoration funding provided by Teatro Della Pace Film and special thanks to Paul Zaentz, the feature returns to the big screen in 4k at Everyman The Whiteley on Thursday, 9 October.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Jack Nicholson\",\"Louise Fletcher\",\"William Redfield\",\"Brad Dourif\",\"Will Sampson\",\"Christopher Lloyd\",\"Danny DeVito\",\"Dean R. Brooks\",\"Peter Brocco\",\"Michael Berryman\"],\"direction\":[\"Milos Forman\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1e66a7a39c5d3850a388942f873385c4.jpg\",\"pictures/14/02/26/13/47/055754.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889063.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889062.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889061.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889060.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889059.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889058.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889057.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889056.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/87/08/25/19889055.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1e66a7a39c5d3850a388942f873385c4.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2017-04-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"BFI Distribution\"}},{\"id\":\"1000028983\",\"title\":\"ParaNorman (Remastered)\",\"runtime\":6300,\"genres\":\"Animation, Family\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"398118\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/bc39d048eaca2246b812754987883964.jpg\",\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ab/da/abda7f2c38038b754c58c4e1d71bdf4d.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Sam\",\"lastName\":\"Fell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Chris\",\"lastName\":\"Butler\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kodi\",\"lastName\":\"Smit-McPhee\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tucker\",\"lastName\":\"Albrizzi\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Anna\",\"lastName\":\"Kendrick\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-10-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"PG\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"ParaNorman (Remastered)\",\"synopsis\":\"From the visionary makers behind Coraline, ParaNorman returns to cinemas this\\nHalloween - bigger, bolder, and spookier than ever!\\nCelebrate the 13th anniversary of this award-winning animated favorite with an eye-\\npopping re-release in stunningly remastered 3D and 2D formats. Get your gang together\\nfor this frightfully fun zombie romp—and catch an exclusive bonus: the brand-new\\nanimated short The Thrifting, featuring Anna Kendrick as Courtney and introducing a new\\ncharacter voiced by Finn Wolfhard.\\nWhen the quiet town of Blithe Hollow is overrun by zombies, only 11-year-old Norman\\nBabcock—who can see and speak with ghosts—can stop the chaos. With a centuries-old\\nwitch’s curse, mysterious ghosts, wily witches, and clueless grown-ups, Norman’s\\nparanormal powers are about to be tested like never before.\\nWith voice talents including Kodi Smit-McPhee, Anna Kendrick, Casey Affleck,\\nChristopher Mintz-Plasse, and more, it’s a frightfully funny, magically thrilling adventure\\nfor the whole family in eye-popping stop-motion.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/67/92/67923783f251b289eef9a50b8f549d02.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/35e4e4c6431a0c2504255f0b88df15ae.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/bc39d048eaca2246b812754987883964.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"From the visionary makers behind Coraline, ParaNorman returns to cinemas this Halloween - bigger, bolder, and spookier than ever!\\n\\nCelebrate the 13th anniversary of this award-winning animated favourite with an eye-popping re-release in stunningly remastered 3D and 2D formats. Get your gang together for this frightfully fun zombie romp—and catch an exclusive bonus: the brand-new animated short The Thrifting, featuring Anna Kendrick as Courtney and introducing a new\\ncharacter voiced by Finn Wolfhard.\\n\\nWhen the quiet town of Blithe Hollow is overrun by zombies, only 11-year-old Norman Babcock—who can see and speak with ghosts—can stop the chaos. With a centuries-old witch’s curse, mysterious ghosts, wily witches, and clueless grown-ups, Norman’s paranormal powers are about to be tested like never before.\\n\\nWith voice talents including Kodi Smit-McPhee, Anna Kendrick, Casey Affleck, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, and more, it’s a frightfully funny, magically thrilling adventure for the whole family in eye-popping stop-motion.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/4773178dbe4cad2c403ac31d8c114089.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"ParaNorman (Remastered)\",\"synopsis\":\"From the visionary makers behind Coraline, ParaNorman returns to cinemas this Halloween - bigger, bolder, and spookier than ever!\\n\\nCelebrate the 13th anniversary of this award-winning animated favourite with an eye-popping re-release in stunningly remastered 3D and 2D formats. Get your gang together for this frightfully fun zombie romp—and catch an exclusive bonus: the brand-new animated short The Thrifting, featuring Anna Kendrick as Courtney and introducing a new\\ncharacter voiced by Finn Wolfhard.\\n\\nWhen the quiet town of Blithe Hollow is overrun by zombies, only 11-year-old Norman Babcock—who can see and speak with ghosts—can stop the chaos. With a centuries-old witch’s curse, mysterious ghosts, wily witches, and clueless grown-ups, Norman’s paranormal powers are about to be tested like never before.\\n\\nWith voice talents including Kodi Smit-McPhee, Anna Kendrick, Casey Affleck, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, and more, it’s a frightfully funny, magically thrilling adventure for the whole family in eye-popping stop-motion.\",\"certificate\":\"PG\",\"casting\":[\"Kodi Smit-McPhee\",\"Tucker Albrizzi\",\"Anna Kendrick\"],\"direction\":[\"Sam Fell\",\"Chris Butler\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/4773178dbe4cad2c403ac31d8c114089.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/4773178dbe4cad2c403ac31d8c114089.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/35e4e4c6431a0c2504255f0b88df15ae.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-10-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"18530\",\"title\":\"Perfect Blue\",\"runtime\":4860,\"genres\":\"Animation, Thriller\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d82cdd4eda2547019d619c5f09bd99ba.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"21722\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/35/91/41/19462907.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/35/91/41/19462906.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306665.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306664.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306663.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306662.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306661.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306660.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306659.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306658.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Satoshi\",\"lastName\":\"Kon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Junko\",\"lastName\":\"Iwao\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rica\",\"lastName\":\"Matsumoto\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Shinpachi\",\"lastName\":\"Tsuji\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Masaaki\",\"lastName\":\"Ôkura\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Yoku\",\"lastName\":\"Shioya\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Hideyuki\",\"lastName\":\"Hori\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Emi\",\"lastName\":\"Shinohara\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Masashi\",\"lastName\":\"Ebara\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kiyoyuki\",\"lastName\":\"Yanada\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tôru\",\"lastName\":\"Furusawa\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"embargoes\":[],\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"1999-10-11T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"for strong violence, nudity and language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"18\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16213\",\"name\":\"Manga Entertainment\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Perfect Blue\",\"synopsis\":\"Mima was a pop idol, worshipped by the masses until fashion dictated otherwise. In order to salvage her career, she is advised to drop music and pursue acting. A soap opera role is offered but Mima's character is less clean cut than desired. Regardless, she agrees and events take a turn for the worse. She begins to feel reality slip, that her life is not her own. She discovers (imagines) her identical twin, a mirror image that hasn't given up singing. Internet sites appear describing every intimate detail of her life and a figure stalks her from the shadows. Her friends and associates are threatened (and killed) as Mima descends into a dangerous world of paranoid delusion. She fears for her life and must unravel fact from illusion in order to stay alive. Perfect Blue represents a major change from traditional anime subject matter, analysing the pop icon phenomenon, fame and its psychological impact on the performer.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9e/e7/9ee77ead68545484f81aa54892cae5ea.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d82cdd4eda2547019d619c5f09bd99ba.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Mima was a pop idol, worshipped by the masses until fashion dictated otherwise. In order to salvage her career, she is advised to drop music and pursue acting. A soap opera role is offered but Mima's character is less clean cut than desired. Regardless, she agrees and events take a turn for the worse. \\n\\nShe begins to feel reality slip, that her life is not her own. She discovers (imagines) her identical twin, a mirror image that hasn't given up singing. Internet sites appear describing every intimate detail of her life and a figure stalks her from the shadows. Her friends and associates are threatened (and killed) as Mima descends into a dangerous world of paranoid delusion. \\nShe fears for her life and must unravel fact from illusion in order to stay alive. \\n\\nPerfect Blue represents a major change from traditional anime subject matter, analysing the pop icon phenomenon, fame and its psychological impact on the performer.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/954b80228221f063a225e981cde8beaf.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Perfect Blue\",\"synopsis\":\"Mima was a pop idol, worshipped by the masses until fashion dictated otherwise. In order to salvage her career, she is advised to drop music and pursue acting. A soap opera role is offered but Mima's character is less clean cut than desired. Regardless, she agrees and events take a turn for the worse. \\n\\nShe begins to feel reality slip, that her life is not her own. She discovers (imagines) her identical twin, a mirror image that hasn't given up singing. Internet sites appear describing every intimate detail of her life and a figure stalks her from the shadows. Her friends and associates are threatened (and killed) as Mima descends into a dangerous world of paranoid delusion. \\nShe fears for her life and must unravel fact from illusion in order to stay alive. \\n\\nPerfect Blue represents a major change from traditional anime subject matter, analysing the pop icon phenomenon, fame and its psychological impact on the performer.\",\"certificate\":\"18\",\"casting\":[\"Junko Iwao\",\"Rica Matsumoto\",\"Shinpachi Tsuji\",\"Masaaki Ôkura\",\"Yoku Shioya\",\"Hideyuki Hori\",\"Emi Shinohara\",\"Masashi Ebara\",\"Kiyoyuki Yanada\",\"Tôru Furusawa\"],\"direction\":[\"Satoshi Kon\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/954b80228221f063a225e981cde8beaf.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/35/91/41/19462907.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/35/91/41/19462906.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306665.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306664.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306663.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306662.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306661.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306660.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306659.jpg\",\"medias/nmedia/18/76/07/07/19306658.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/954b80228221f063a225e981cde8beaf.jpg\"],\"release\":\"1999-10-11T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"for strong violence, nudity and language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Manga Entertainment\"}},{\"id\":\"326652\",\"title\":\"Predator: Badlands\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Science fiction, Action, Horror\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"365319\",\"393821\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/19484c265d1b3cc013032ba515f3f147.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ea/a9/eaa9b3377948a2339c7a447710bd01bd.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/90/c7/90c78c98029a815378a77945c5bfcdc6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/bb/69/bb69c478c4004af432ac015d22af7ebd.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c6/c4/c6c4b6dba7cefdef773404d426e1990b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/dc/48/dc4852a080892ec7d302bb2299fe4112.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/56/f0/56f089fb54987fdbcd8a17b4fe8dfecf.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/2d/ef/2deff9d6cb4b6d66523f854f097cf6fe.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e5/b9/e5b996d90a460e9b8b860ca605376bcf.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5e/2f/5e2faaa2b23ccb8f12c8ed6211742eda.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e9/21/e921981b1cd2255226156c7cbda26874.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Dan\",\"lastName\":\"Trachtenberg\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Elle\",\"lastName\":\"Fanning\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dimitrius\",\"lastName\":\"Schuster-Koloamatangi\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-07T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Predator: Badlands\",\"synopsis\":null,\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/19484c265d1b3cc013032ba515f3f147.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Cast out from its clan, an alien hunter and an unlikely ally embark on a treacherous journey in search of the ultimate adversary.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ab26463f77439a86c16f88c50542a28a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Predator: Badlands\",\"synopsis\":\"Cast out from its clan, an alien hunter and an unlikely ally embark on a treacherous journey in search of the ultimate adversary.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Elle Fanning\",\"Dimitrius Schuster-Koloamatangi\"],\"direction\":[\"Dan Trachtenberg\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ab26463f77439a86c16f88c50542a28a.jpg\",\"img/ea/a9/eaa9b3377948a2339c7a447710bd01bd.jpg\",\"img/90/c7/90c78c98029a815378a77945c5bfcdc6.jpg\",\"img/bb/69/bb69c478c4004af432ac015d22af7ebd.jpg\",\"img/c6/c4/c6c4b6dba7cefdef773404d426e1990b.jpg\",\"img/dc/48/dc4852a080892ec7d302bb2299fe4112.jpg\",\"img/56/f0/56f089fb54987fdbcd8a17b4fe8dfecf.jpg\",\"img/2d/ef/2deff9d6cb4b6d66523f854f097cf6fe.jpg\",\"img/e5/b9/e5b996d90a460e9b8b860ca605376bcf.jpg\",\"img/5e/2f/5e2faaa2b23ccb8f12c8ed6211742eda.jpg\",\"img/e9/21/e921981b1cd2255226156c7cbda26874.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ab26463f77439a86c16f88c50542a28a.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-11-07T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Walt Disney\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022513\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Cinderella\",\"runtime\":11700,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/2cac32d15a8827274a8d5a3db727a5d0.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390067\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Frederick\",\"lastName\":\"Ashton\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Fumi\",\"lastName\":\"Kaneko\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"William\",\"lastName\":\"Bracewell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Bennet\",\"lastName\":\"Gartside\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"James\",\"lastName\":\"Hay\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Cinderella\",\"synopsis\":\"Stuck at home and put to work by her spoiled Step-Sisters, Cinderella’s life is dreary and dull. Everything changes when she helps a mysterious woman out... With a little bit of magic, she is transported into an ethereal new world – one where fairies bring the gifts of the seasons, where pumpkins turn into carriages, and where true love awaits.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/1c/0a/1c0a9859bfa31273300d1c115c227ea5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Cinderella\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/2cac32d15a8827274a8d5a3db727a5d0.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Stuck at home and put to work by her spoiled Step-Sisters, Cinderella’s life is dreary and dull. Everything changes when she helps a mysterious woman out...With a little bit of magic, she is transported into an ethereal new world – one where fairies bring the gifts of the seasons, where pumpkins turn into carriages, and where true love awaits. \\n\\nThis enchanting ballet by The Royal Ballet’s Founding Choreographer Frederick Ashton is a theatrical experience for all the family and will transport you into an ethereal world where a sprinkling of fairy dust makes dreams come true.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7e8e55c86c93ac43749f22cc4d9102a9.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Cinderella\",\"synopsis\":\"Stuck at home and put to work by her spoiled Step-Sisters, Cinderella’s life is dreary and dull. Everything changes when she helps a mysterious woman out...With a little bit of magic, she is transported into an ethereal new world – one where fairies bring the gifts of the seasons, where pumpkins turn into carriages, and where true love awaits. \\n\\nThis enchanting ballet by The Royal Ballet’s Founding Choreographer Frederick Ashton is a theatrical experience for all the family and will transport you into an ethereal world where a sprinkling of fairy dust makes dreams come true.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Fumi Kaneko\",\"William Bracewell\",\"Bennet Gartside\",\"James Hay\"],\"direction\":[\"Frederick Ashton\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7e8e55c86c93ac43749f22cc4d9102a9.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7e8e55c86c93ac43749f22cc4d9102a9.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-11-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022520\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Giselle\",\"runtime\":12600,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/c31ec6fcba293a62fce07b331856d656.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390078\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"directors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-03-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Giselle\",\"synopsis\":\"The world turns upside down for the peasant girl Giselle when she discovers her lover Albrecht is actually a nobleman promised to another. In despair, she kills herself. Her spirit joins the Wilis, the vengeful ghosts of women who have been jilted and die before their wedding day. The Wilis are hell-bent on killing any man who crosses their path in a dance to the death. Wracked with guilt, Albrecht visits Giselle’s grave, where he must face the Wilis – and Giselle’s ghost. Will he survive?\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/47/a3/47a36844746dc637e42bd35172134fde.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Giselle\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/c31ec6fcba293a62fce07b331856d656.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"The peasant girl Giselle has fallen in love with Albrecht. When she discovers that he is actually a nobleman promised to another, she kills herself in despair. Her spirit joins the Wilis: the vengeful ghosts of women hell-bent on killing any man who crosses their path in a dance to the death. Wracked with guilt, Albrecht visits Giselle’s grave, where he must face the Wilis – and Giselle’s ghost. \\n\\nPeter Wright’s 1985 production of this quintessential Romantic ballet is a classic of The Royal Ballet repertory. Set to Adolphe Adam’s evocative score and with atmospheric designs by John Macfarlane, Giselle conjures up the earthly and otherworldly realms in a tale of love, betrayal and redemption.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a636ce755e4fff88f833d412bc653308.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Giselle\",\"synopsis\":\"The peasant girl Giselle has fallen in love with Albrecht. When she discovers that he is actually a nobleman promised to another, she kills herself in despair. Her spirit joins the Wilis: the vengeful ghosts of women hell-bent on killing any man who crosses their path in a dance to the death. Wracked with guilt, Albrecht visits Giselle’s grave, where he must face the Wilis – and Giselle’s ghost. \\n\\nPeter Wright’s 1985 production of this quintessential Romantic ballet is a classic of The Royal Ballet repertory. Set to Adolphe Adam’s evocative score and with atmospheric designs by John Macfarlane, Giselle conjures up the earthly and otherworldly realms in a tale of love, betrayal and redemption.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a636ce755e4fff88f833d412bc653308.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a636ce755e4fff88f833d412bc653308.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-03-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022516\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: La Fille Mal Gardée\",\"runtime\":12600,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3620cd8038656a05e5580a3018292bde.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390071\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Frederick\",\"lastName\":\"Ashton\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Francesca\",\"lastName\":\"Hayward\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marcelino\",\"lastName\":\"Sambé\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: La Fille Mal Gardée\",\"synopsis\":\"Lise is the only daughter of Widow Simone, the owner of a prosperous farm. She is in love with the young farmer Colas, but her mother has higher ambitions for her, hoping to marry her off to Alain, the son of the wealthy proprietor Thomas. Desperate to marry Colas rather than Alain, Lise contrives to outwit her mother’s plans.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/44/69/446915ef6d1953da01276974e761542a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: La Fille Mal Gardée\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3620cd8038656a05e5580a3018292bde.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Lise, the only daughter of Widow Simone, is in love with the young farmer Colas, but her mother has far more ambitious plans for her. Simone hopes to marry her off to Alain, the son of the wealthy proprietor Thomas. Desperate to marry Colas rather than Alain, Lise contrives to outwit her mother’s plans.  \\n\\n65 years after its premiere, The Royal Ballet presents Frederick Ashton’s La Fille mal gardée. This affectionate portrayal of village life combines exuberant good humour and brilliantly inventive choreography in what is undoubtedly Ashton’s love letter to the English countryside. La Fille mal gardée whisks us away into pastoral bliss with Ferdinand Hérold’s cheerful score and Osbert Lancaster’s colourful designs.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d164f9907ba8bb2b8e7dde48bebe92c9.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: La Fille Mal Gardée\",\"synopsis\":\"Lise, the only daughter of Widow Simone, is in love with the young farmer Colas, but her mother has far more ambitious plans for her. Simone hopes to marry her off to Alain, the son of the wealthy proprietor Thomas. Desperate to marry Colas rather than Alain, Lise contrives to outwit her mother’s plans.  \\n\\n65 years after its premiere, The Royal Ballet presents Frederick Ashton’s La Fille mal gardée. This affectionate portrayal of village life combines exuberant good humour and brilliantly inventive choreography in what is undoubtedly Ashton’s love letter to the English countryside. La Fille mal gardée whisks us away into pastoral bliss with Ferdinand Hérold’s cheerful score and Osbert Lancaster’s colourful designs.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Francesca Hayward\",\"Marcelino Sambé\"],\"direction\":[\"Frederick Ashton\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d164f9907ba8bb2b8e7dde48bebe92c9.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d164f9907ba8bb2b8e7dde48bebe92c9.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-11-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022518\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: La Traviata\",\"runtime\":14400,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/2cc10a0cc2b8ddb28a1b619eb9698eec.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390073\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Richard\",\"lastName\":\"Eyre\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ermonela\",\"lastName\":\"Jaho\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Giovanni\",\"lastName\":\"Sala\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Antonello\",\"lastName\":\"Manacorda\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Aleksei\",\"lastName\":\"Isaev\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Veena\",\"lastName\":\"Akama-Makia\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-01-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: La Traviata\",\"synopsis\":\"A moving story about a woman in love that features one of opera’s most famous melodies (the ‘Brindisi’ chorus), La traviata is perfect for first-timers and a favourite among regular opera-goers. Antonello Manacorda conducts a cast headlined by soprano Ermonela Jaho. In director Richard Eyre’s world of seductive grandeur, the tender and devastating beauty at the centre of Verdi’s opera shines bright.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/32/af/32af8a776da1919f60832d88259dba48.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: La Traviata\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/2cc10a0cc2b8ddb28a1b619eb9698eec.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"At one of her lavish parties, celebrated Parisan courtesan Violetta is introduced to Alfredo Germont. The two fall madly in love, and though hesitant to leave behind her life of luxury and freedom, Violetta follows her heart. But the young couple’s happiness is short-lived, as the harsh realities of life soon come knocking.\\n\\nAs intimate as it is sumptuous, La traviata features some of opera’s most famous melodies, and is a star vehicle for its leading soprano role sung by Ermonela Jaho. In director Richard Eyre’s world of seductive grandeur, the tender and devastating beauty at the centre of Verdi’s opera shines bright.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/6b0e9d6243a48af9639a85e4075c18cd.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: La Traviata\",\"synopsis\":\"At one of her lavish parties, celebrated Parisan courtesan Violetta is introduced to Alfredo Germont. The two fall madly in love, and though hesitant to leave behind her life of luxury and freedom, Violetta follows her heart. But the young couple’s happiness is short-lived, as the harsh realities of life soon come knocking.\\n\\nAs intimate as it is sumptuous, La traviata features some of opera’s most famous melodies, and is a star vehicle for its leading soprano role sung by Ermonela Jaho. In director Richard Eyre’s world of seductive grandeur, the tender and devastating beauty at the centre of Verdi’s opera shines bright.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Ermonela Jaho\",\"Giovanni Sala\",\"Antonello Manacorda\",\"Aleksei Isaev\",\"Veena Akama-Makia\"],\"direction\":[\"Richard Eyre\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/6b0e9d6243a48af9639a85e4075c18cd.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/6b0e9d6243a48af9639a85e4075c18cd.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-01-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022521\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Siegfried\",\"runtime\":19800,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/cc116e25c1ddb2e2a4f0e889ee820d1e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390081\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Barrie\",\"lastName\":\"Kosky\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Andreas\",\"lastName\":\"Schager\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Peter\",\"lastName\":\"Hoare\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Maltman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Elisabet\",\"lastName\":\"Strid\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Purves\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Soloman\",\"lastName\":\"Howard\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-03-31T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Siegfried\",\"synopsis\":\"Andreas Schager, in his much-anticipated debut with The Royal Opera, stars as Siegfried’s titular hero, alongside Christopher Maltman’s towering Wanderer, Peter Hoare’s treacherous Mime and Elisabet Strid’s radiant Brünnhilde. Antonio Pappano conducts, drawing out the unspoken tensions and ethereal mysticism of Wagner’s dynamic score.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/1c/c3/1cc3cf10840deb5c68256f8a39aee71b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Siegfried\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/cc116e25c1ddb2e2a4f0e889ee820d1e.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/44dd66d4e4c8cff7b75a8cfe2139c241.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Siegfried\",\"synopsis\":\"Andreas Schager, in his much-anticipated debut with The Royal Opera, stars as Siegfried’s titular hero, alongside Christopher Maltman’s towering Wanderer, Peter Hoare’s treacherous Mime and Elisabet Strid’s radiant Brünnhilde. Antonio Pappano conducts, drawing out the unspoken tensions and ethereal mysticism of Wagner’s dynamic score.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Andreas Schager\",\"Peter Hoare\",\"Christopher Maltman\",\"Elisabet Strid\",\"Christopher Purves\",\"Soloman Howard\"],\"direction\":[\"Barrie Kosky\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/44dd66d4e4c8cff7b75a8cfe2139c241.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/44dd66d4e4c8cff7b75a8cfe2139c241.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-03-31T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022522\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: The Magic Flute\",\"runtime\":12600,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/438988d4479fed858ad4649301c84135.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390082\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"David\",\"lastName\":\"McVicar\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Julia\",\"lastName\":\"Bullock\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Amitai\",\"lastName\":\"PATI\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Huw\",\"lastName\":\"Montague Rendall\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-04-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: The Magic Flute\",\"synopsis\":\"A fantastical opera for all the family \\n\\nPrincess Pamina has been captured. Her mother, the Queen of the Night, tasks the young Prince Tamino with her daughter’s rescue. But when Tamino and his friendly sidekick, Papageno, embark on their adventure, they soon learn that when it comes to the quest for love, nothing is as it really seems. Guided by a magic flute, they encounter monsters, villains, and a mysterious brotherhood of men – but help, it turns out, comes when you least expect it. \\n\\nWith the Queen of the Night’s showstopping arias, an Overture that fizzes with energy, Papageno’s catchy tunes and sublime melodies for Pamina and Tamino, the music of The Magic Flute leaves no heart uncharmed. Two starry casts include Julia Bullock and Lucy Crowe as Pamina, Amitai Pati and Mingjie Lei as Tamino, Huw Montague Rendall as Papageno, Kathryn Lewek and Annie Fassea as the Queen of the Night and Soloman Howard and Timo Riihonen as Sarastro, led by French conductor Marie Jacquot in her Covent Garden debut, and Finnegan Downie Dear.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5c/a2/5ca2be939cc3d01b3936eb2886ecaf7d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: The Magic Flute\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/438988d4479fed858ad4649301c84135.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"A fantastical opera for all the family \\n\\nPrincess Pamina has been captured. Her mother, the Queen of the Night, tasks the young Prince Tamino with her daughter’s rescue. But when Tamino and his friendly sidekick, Papageno, embark on their adventure, they soon learn that when it comes to the quest for love, nothing is as it really seems. Guided by a magic flute, they encounter monsters, villains, and a mysterious brotherhood of men – but help, it turns out, comes when you least expect it. \\n\\nWith the Queen of the Night’s showstopping arias, an Overture that fizzes with energy, Papageno’s catchy tunes, and sublime melodies for Pamina and Tamino, the music of The Magic Flute leaves no heart uncharmed. Two starry casts include Julia Bullock and Lucy Crowe as Pamina, Amitai Pati and Mingjie Lei as Tamino, Huw Montague Rendall as Papageno, Kathryn Lewek and Annie Fassea as the Queen of the Night and Soloman Howard and Timo Riihonen as Sarastro, led by French conductor Marie Jacquot in her Covent Garden debut, and Finnegan Downie Dear.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/42e97987d1e1fcd5f19d2d9a7f33cb8b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: The Magic Flute\",\"synopsis\":\"A fantastical opera for all the family \\n\\nPrincess Pamina has been captured. Her mother, the Queen of the Night, tasks the young Prince Tamino with her daughter’s rescue. But when Tamino and his friendly sidekick, Papageno, embark on their adventure, they soon learn that when it comes to the quest for love, nothing is as it really seems. Guided by a magic flute, they encounter monsters, villains, and a mysterious brotherhood of men – but help, it turns out, comes when you least expect it. \\n\\nWith the Queen of the Night’s showstopping arias, an Overture that fizzes with energy, Papageno’s catchy tunes, and sublime melodies for Pamina and Tamino, the music of The Magic Flute leaves no heart uncharmed. Two starry casts include Julia Bullock and Lucy Crowe as Pamina, Amitai Pati and Mingjie Lei as Tamino, Huw Montague Rendall as Papageno, Kathryn Lewek and Annie Fassea as the Queen of the Night and Soloman Howard and Timo Riihonen as Sarastro, led by French conductor Marie Jacquot in her Covent Garden debut, and Finnegan Downie Dear.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Julia Bullock\",\"Amitai PATI\",\"Huw Montague Rendall\"],\"direction\":[\"David McVicar\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/42e97987d1e1fcd5f19d2d9a7f33cb8b.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/42e97987d1e1fcd5f19d2d9a7f33cb8b.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-04-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022517\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: The Nutcracker\",\"runtime\":12600,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5823b05d5775e2889c88ab8131e0db0d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390072\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Peter\",\"lastName\":\"Wright\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-12-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: The Nutcracker\",\"synopsis\":\"Peter Wright's production of The Nutcracker has been enchanting children and adults alike since its first performance by The Royal Ballet in 1984. Julia Trevelyan Oman’s designs bring the story wonderfully to life, from the 19th century German home of the Stalbaums – which features a Christmas tree that transforms beyond one’s imagination – to the Kingdom of Sweets, where everything is sugar and sparkle.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c8/a5/c8a5446da3a6f7c0f9097f483e3410e4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: The Nutcracker\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5823b05d5775e2889c88ab8131e0db0d.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"The magician Herr Drosselmeyer needs to save his nephew. Hans-Peter has been transformed into a Nutcracker; the only way to save him is for the Nutcracker to defeat the Mouse King and find a girl to love and care for him. A flicker of hope comes in the form of the young Clara, whom Drosselmeyer meets at a Christmas party. With some magic, a cosy Christmas gathering turns into a marvellous adventure. \\n\\nPeter Wright’s The Nutcracker has enchanted audiences since its 1984 premiere by the Company. Featuring Tchaikovsky’s most familiar melodies and brought to life by Julia Trevelyan Oman’s exquisite designs, The Nutcracker is sure to be a festive firecracker for all ages.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/cc5c4998a7dc6a9ac9146bbaccaa7676.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: The Nutcracker\",\"synopsis\":\"The magician Herr Drosselmeyer needs to save his nephew. Hans-Peter has been transformed into a Nutcracker; the only way to save him is for the Nutcracker to defeat the Mouse King and find a girl to love and care for him. A flicker of hope comes in the form of the young Clara, whom Drosselmeyer meets at a Christmas party. With some magic, a cosy Christmas gathering turns into a marvellous adventure. \\n\\nPeter Wright’s The Nutcracker has enchanted audiences since its 1984 premiere by the Company. Featuring Tchaikovsky’s most familiar melodies and brought to life by Julia Trevelyan Oman’s exquisite designs, The Nutcracker is sure to be a festive firecracker for all ages.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Peter Wright\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/cc5c4998a7dc6a9ac9146bbaccaa7676.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/cc5c4998a7dc6a9ac9146bbaccaa7676.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-12-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022514\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Tosca\",\"runtime\":12600,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9e5c3c16d2a97ac92b1d0c0a46a0b1c3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390068\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Oliver\",\"lastName\":\"Mears\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Anna\",\"lastName\":\"Netrebko\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Freddie\",\"lastName\":\"De Tommaso\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Gerald\",\"lastName\":\"Finley\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Carlo\",\"lastName\":\"Bosi\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-10-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Tosca\",\"synopsis\":\"In war-torn Rome, Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced into making a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fc/d5/fcd51687d67de887be2af417ffb7eb50.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Tosca\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9e5c3c16d2a97ac92b1d0c0a46a0b1c3.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"In war-torn Rome, Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out? \\n\\nA star-studded cast includes soprano Anna Netrebko performing the role of Tosca, tenor Freddie De Tommaso as Cavaradossi, and bass-baritone Gerald Finley as Scarpia, with Music Director of The Royal Opera Jakub Hrůša conducting his first new production in the role. An alternative, modern-day Rome provides the backdrop for Oliver Mears’ unmissable, gripping new production of Puccini’s thriller.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/05b46a11d0504d13dafc034262f4713a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Tosca\",\"synopsis\":\"In war-torn Rome, Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out? \\n\\nA star-studded cast includes soprano Anna Netrebko performing the role of Tosca, tenor Freddie De Tommaso as Cavaradossi, and bass-baritone Gerald Finley as Scarpia, with Music Director of The Royal Opera Jakub Hrůša conducting his first new production in the role. An alternative, modern-day Rome provides the backdrop for Oliver Mears’ unmissable, gripping new production of Puccini’s thriller.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Anna Netrebko\",\"Freddie De Tommaso\",\"Gerald Finley\",\"Carlo Bosi\"],\"direction\":[\"Oliver Mears\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/05b46a11d0504d13dafc034262f4713a.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/05b46a11d0504d13dafc034262f4713a.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-10-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000022519\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Woolf Works\",\"runtime\":12600,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d5bc30916696a4e51b6d4df14d0d5462.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"390074\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Wayne\",\"lastName\":\"McGregor\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-02-09T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Woolf Works\",\"synopsis\":\"I now, I then (from Mrs Dalloway)  \\n\\nMrs Dalloway, Woolf’s 1925 stream of consciousness novel, is set over the course of one day and alternates between two stories: a society hostess preparing for an important party and a shell-shocked war veteran on his way to a psychiatric assessment. Though they never meet, both Clarissa, the protected insider and Septimus, the social outcast, are haunted by the past. Opening with an excerpt from Woolf’s recorded essay, On Craftsmanship, I now I then is a journey into the writing of Mrs Dalloway, interweaving narrative fragments from the novel with aspects of Woolf’s autobiography including the experience of drawing on her own mental illness as subject matter. \\n\\nBecomings (from Orlando) \\n\\n‘on or about December 1910 human nature changed’ – Virginia Woolf  \\n\\nWritten in an epoch of recalibration in every sphere including the roles and rights of women, modes of representation in art and literature, and rapid advances in cosmology, Woolf’s iconoclastic 1928 novel Orlando centres around a fantastical figure who journeys through three hundred years without growing old, and changes sex along the way. Relationships prove transient, even with himself, while relativity and plasticity define her experience of time and space. Becomings presents Orlando’s dizzying wide-angle vision of a vast, ever-altering universe in which life is energy passing through a multiplicity of forms – a brief, gorgeous flaring of insect wings, gestating, emerging, extinguishing and moving on. \\n\\nTuesday (from The Waves) \\n\\nGrand and elegiac, The Waves (1931) is Woolf’s most experimental novel, conceived in response to her own childlessness and the contrasting fierce maternity of her sister Vanessa. In the novel, the voices of six people growing from childhood to old age are punctuated by symbols of natural decay and renewal, the most important of which is the ever-returning sea. Responding to Woolf’s unique fascination with underwater imagery in all her writing, Tuesday merges themes of The Waves with a portrayal of the writer’s suicide by drowning. As Woolf counts her steps towards the river Ouse and her final journey, so too the world of her novel moves towards abstraction and silence.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3b/34/3b34dce89ff63bbe628f65c12b90ed39.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Woolf Works\",\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d5bc30916696a4e51b6d4df14d0d5462.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Virginia Woolf defied literary conventions to depict rich inner worlds – her heightened, startling and poignant reality. Resident Choreographer Wayne McGregor leads a luminous artistic team to evoke Woolf’s signature stream of consciousness writing style in this immense work that rejects traditional narrative structures. \\n\\nWoolf Works is a collage of themes from Mrs Dalloway, Orlando, The Waves and Woolf’s other writings. Created in 2015 for The Royal Ballet, this Olivier-award winning ballet triptych captures the heart of Woolf’s uniquely artistic spirit.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/162aa706edb9057771bcc9000957a30e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Woolf Works\",\"synopsis\":\"Virginia Woolf defied literary conventions to depict rich inner worlds – her heightened, startling and poignant reality. Resident Choreographer Wayne McGregor leads a luminous artistic team to evoke Woolf’s signature stream of consciousness writing style in this immense work that rejects traditional narrative structures. \\n\\nWoolf Works is a collage of themes from Mrs Dalloway, Orlando, The Waves and Woolf’s other writings. Created in 2015 for The Royal Ballet, this Olivier-award winning ballet triptych captures the heart of Woolf’s uniquely artistic spirit.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Wayne McGregor\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/162aa706edb9057771bcc9000957a30e.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/162aa706edb9057771bcc9000957a30e.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-02-09T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}},{\"id\":\"1000026762\",\"title\":\"Reality Is Not Enough\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Documentary\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"395403\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/abab1a1fd6e9b254082d7aa6400f67ac.jpg\",\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Paul\",\"lastName\":\"Sng\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Irvine\",\"lastName\":\"Welsh\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Darren\",\"lastName\":\"Emerson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Emma\",\"lastName\":\"Currie\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dean\",\"lastName\":\"Cavanagh\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"drug misuse, very strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"18\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"17550\",\"name\":\"Kaleidoscope Entertainment\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Reality Is Not Enough\",\"synopsis\":\"REALITY IS NOT ENOUGH reveals the inner and outer lives of Irvine Welsh, one of the most original and controversial writers of our times. For four decades across novels, screenplays and an outspoken presence in media, the Trainspotting author has both celebrated and defined contemporary society and culture, whilst simultaneously exposing its flaws. In this intimate and personal documentary we meet Welsh at a crossroads, acutely aware of his mortality and accepting that his hedonistic days are drawing to a close.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/af/aa/afaac8597426d327aafefce6a5bc9bd8.png\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/abab1a1fd6e9b254082d7aa6400f67ac.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Irvine Welsh is at a crossroads. After experiencing the huge success of several film adaptations and six million books sold worldwide, he has become acutely aware of his own mortality. \\n\\nNow, with his hedonistic days drawing to a close, the outspoken author decides to explore the boundaries of consciousness through a psychedelic DMT trip.\\n\\n\\n\\nThrough this unique lens, join Welsh on a brutally honest examination of his life: how his creativity was fostered by his childhood in Edinburgh; the influences he gained living amongst 70’s London counterculture; and how groundbreaking work such as Trainspotting and Filth pulled him out of a self-destructive cycle, but also led him to heights of fame he never could have imagined. And still one burning question remains – what will come next?\\n\\n\\n\\nThis captivating piece of autobiographical filmmaking combines intimate observational footage with readings from his novels narrated by Liam Neeson (Batman Begins, Star Wars), Stephen Graham (Adolescence, The Irishman), musician Nick Cave, Ruth Negga (Ad Astra, Passing) and Maxine Peake (The Theory of Everything, Shameless).\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Reality Is Not Enough\",\"synopsis\":\"Irvine Welsh is at a crossroads. After experiencing the huge success of several film adaptations and six million books sold worldwide, he has become acutely aware of his own mortality. \\n\\nNow, with his hedonistic days drawing to a close, the outspoken author decides to explore the boundaries of consciousness through a psychedelic DMT trip.\\n\\n\\n\\nThrough this unique lens, join Welsh on a brutally honest examination of his life: how his creativity was fostered by his childhood in Edinburgh; the influences he gained living amongst 70’s London counterculture; and how groundbreaking work such as Trainspotting and Filth pulled him out of a self-destructive cycle, but also led him to heights of fame he never could have imagined. And still one burning question remains – what will come next?\\n\\n\\n\\nThis captivating piece of autobiographical filmmaking combines intimate observational footage with readings from his novels narrated by Liam Neeson (Batman Begins, Star Wars), Stephen Graham (Adolescence, The Irishman), musician Nick Cave, Ruth Negga (Ad Astra, Passing) and Maxine Peake (The Theory of Everything, Shameless).\",\"certificate\":\"18\",\"casting\":[\"Irvine Welsh\",\"Darren Emerson\",\"Emma Currie\",\"Dean Cavanagh\"],\"direction\":[\"Paul Sng\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"drug misuse, very strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Kaleidoscope Entertainment\"}},{\"id\":\"1000009067\",\"title\":\"Regretting You\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Drama, Romance\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"372064\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"img/2a/ff/2affa033527fc19d2a1ce029e67bc481.png\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/cc/79/cc79a7ec57e4e1d8134b85567a77671c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0c/c9/0cc954fb368d5baeed51ff31b5b2e93f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d3/8d/d38d7ccdc0d5e0d3d8bcdfd61c59caca.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c1/a3/c1a35a9b01de91a4e749e77e8bf735ba.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/05/b7/05b7920818512f61bf73b8a8f411e3d9.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/03/d6/03d615742a36c4cc8a3aa4781aef7701.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Josh\",\"lastName\":\"Boone\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Allison\",\"lastName\":\"Williams\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mckenna\",\"lastName\":\"Grace\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dave\",\"lastName\":\"Franco\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mason\",\"lastName\":\"Thames\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Scott\",\"lastName\":\"Eastwood\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Willa\",\"lastName\":\"Fitzgerald\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sam\",\"lastName\":\"Morelos\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Clancy\",\"lastName\":\"Brown\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ethan Samuel\",\"lastName\":\"Costanilla\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marcelle\",\"lastName\":\"LeBlanc\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-10-24T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13760\",\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Regretting You\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on the bestselling book, REGRETTING YOU introduces audiences to Morgan Grant (Allison Williams) and her daughter Clara (Mckenna Grace) as they explore what’s left behind after a devastating accident reveals a shocking betrayal and forces them to confront family secrets, redefine love, and rediscover each other. REGRETTING YOU is a story of growth, resilience, and self-discovery in the aftermath of tragedy, also starring Dave Franco and Mason Thames with Scott Eastwood and Willa Fitzgerald.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/2a/ff/2affa033527fc19d2a1ce029e67bc481.png\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/fa9972ffbfee4b25321c48bd358aad1f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Regretting You\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on the bestselling book, REGRETTING YOU introduces audiences to Morgan Grant (Allison Williams) and her daughter Clara (Mckenna Grace) as they explore what’s left behind after a devastating accident reveals a shocking betrayal and forces them to confront family secrets, redefine love, and rediscover each other. REGRETTING YOU is a story of growth, resilience, and self-discovery in the aftermath of tragedy, also starring Dave Franco and Mason Thames with Scott Eastwood and Willa Fitzgerald.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Allison Williams\",\"Mckenna Grace\",\"Dave Franco\",\"Mason Thames\",\"Scott Eastwood\",\"Willa Fitzgerald\",\"Sam Morelos\",\"Clancy Brown\",\"Ethan Samuel Costanilla\",\"Marcelle LeBlanc\"],\"direction\":[\"Josh Boone\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"img/cc/79/cc79a7ec57e4e1d8134b85567a77671c.jpg\",\"img/0c/c9/0cc954fb368d5baeed51ff31b5b2e93f.jpg\",\"img/d3/8d/d38d7ccdc0d5e0d3d8bcdfd61c59caca.jpg\",\"img/c1/a3/c1a35a9b01de91a4e749e77e8bf735ba.jpg\",\"img/05/b7/05b7920818512f61bf73b8a8f411e3d9.jpg\",\"img/03/d6/03d615742a36c4cc8a3aa4781aef7701.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/fa9972ffbfee4b25321c48bd358aad1f.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-10-24T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\"}},{\"id\":\"323925\",\"title\":\"Rental Family\",\"runtime\":6180,\"genres\":\"Comedy, Drama\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"383271\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e64bcdcf40582910fb00e88d9b0748e4.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6c/69/6c694be8459fa827c75fb5ac21362db1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/88/a9/88a993e55af085216bbbdfe08054f2d8.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/60/ab/60ab4afa7763880ff583d2fe243bcec5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c7/b5/c7b5eb24947d9bca74d2a543c83f228d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d4/f5/d4f5381dd1a3664dabcf395329bb1c78.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/65/5b/655b9507c0fe276e50d83904fc95cd55.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d1/18/d1186a6f6b212afe5a860708081e8872.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Mitsuyo\",\"lastName\":\"Miyazaki\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Brendan\",\"lastName\":\"Fraser\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mari\",\"lastName\":\"Yamamoto\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Takehiro\",\"lastName\":\"Hira\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Akira\",\"lastName\":\"Emoto\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-01-16T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Rental Family\",\"synopsis\":null,\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e64bcdcf40582910fb00e88d9b0748e4.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Struggling to find purpose, an American actor lands an unusual gig with a Japanese agency to play stand-in roles for strangers. As he immerses himself in his clients' worlds, he begins to form genuine bonds that blur the lines between performance and reality. Confronting the moral complexities of his work, he soon rediscovers purpose, belonging, and the quiet beauty of human connection.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e362730428785a903463375826af5d97.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Rental Family\",\"synopsis\":\"Struggling to find purpose, an American actor lands an unusual gig with a Japanese agency to play stand-in roles for strangers. As he immerses himself in his clients' worlds, he begins to form genuine bonds that blur the lines between performance and reality. Confronting the moral complexities of his work, he soon rediscovers purpose, belonging, and the quiet beauty of human connection.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Brendan Fraser\",\"Mari Yamamoto\",\"Takehiro Hira\",\"Akira Emoto\"],\"direction\":[\"Mitsuyo Miyazaki\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e362730428785a903463375826af5d97.jpg\",\"img/6c/69/6c694be8459fa827c75fb5ac21362db1.jpg\",\"img/88/a9/88a993e55af085216bbbdfe08054f2d8.jpg\",\"img/60/ab/60ab4afa7763880ff583d2fe243bcec5.jpg\",\"img/c7/b5/c7b5eb24947d9bca74d2a543c83f228d.jpg\",\"img/d4/f5/d4f5381dd1a3664dabcf395329bb1c78.jpg\",\"img/65/5b/655b9507c0fe276e50d83904fc95cd55.jpg\",\"img/d1/18/d1186a6f6b212afe5a860708081e8872.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e362730428785a903463375826af5d97.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-01-16T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Walt Disney\"}},{\"id\":\"1000030345\",\"title\":\"Rocky Horror Picture Show: Vagabond Special Screening\",\"runtime\":6000,\"genres\":\"Comedy, Horror, Musical\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"399970\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7f30cbae507ea1b3900d05f7e99f35ef.jpg\",\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jim\",\"lastName\":\"Sharman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tim\",\"lastName\":\"Curry\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Susan\",\"lastName\":\"Sarandon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Barry\",\"lastName\":\"Bostwick\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Richard\",\"lastName\":\"O'Brien\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Patricia\",\"lastName\":\"Quinn\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-10-16T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains moderate sex and one use of strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"12435\",\"name\":\"20th Century Studios\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Rocky Horror Picture Show: Vagabond Special Screening\",\"synopsis\":\"Step into the Time Warp with us at Everyman Screen on the Green as we celebrate the release of star of The Rocky Horror Picture Show Tim Curry's first memoir, Vagabond, with a very special screening of the cult classic film. This outrageous, genre-defying musical continues to thrill and delight audiences half a century on—and there’s no better way to experience it than on the big screen, surrounded by fellow fans.\\n \\nThis one-night event also excitingly marks the 50th anniversary of The Rocky Horror Picture Show. Tim Curry’s unforgettable performance as Dr. Frank-N-Furter cemented his place in cinema history, and his new memoir takes readers on a journey through his extraordinary life—from his early days on stage to his defining screen roles and beyond.\\n \\nWe look forward to welcoming you in your best Rocky Horror attire! Expect an evening of celebration, nostalgia, and sheer Rocky Horror joy as we honour both a cinematic milestone and one of the most iconic performers of our time. Whether you’re a seasoned fan or discovering the phenomenon for the first time, this promises to be an unmissable night of music, mischief, and memories.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ba/9c/ba9c88194915049d9d1b3fa740e63fda.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7f30cbae507ea1b3900d05f7e99f35ef.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Step into the Time Warp with us at Everyman Screen on the Green as we celebrate the release of star of The Rocky Horror Picture Show Tim Curry's first memoir, Vagabond, with a very special screening of the cult classic film. This outrageous, genre-defying musical continues to thrill and delight audiences half a century on—and there’s no better way to experience it than on the big screen, surrounded by fellow fans.\\n\\nThis one-night event also excitingly marks the 50th anniversary of The Rocky Horror Picture Show. Tim Curry’s unforgettable performance as Dr. Frank-N-Furter cemented his place in cinema history, and his new memoir takes readers on a journey through his extraordinary life—from his early days on stage to his defining screen roles and beyond.\\n\\nWe look forward to welcoming you in your best Rocky Horror attire! Expect an evening of celebration, nostalgia, and sheer Rocky Horror joy as we honour both a cinematic milestone and one of the most iconic performers of our time. Whether you’re a seasoned fan or discovering the phenomenon for the first time, this promises to be an unmissable night of music, mischief, and memories.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/91f4e6b10d2f1a08d29cf0827658409a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Rocky Horror Picture Show: Vagabond Special Screening\",\"synopsis\":\"Step into the Time Warp with us at Everyman Screen on the Green as we celebrate the release of star of The Rocky Horror Picture Show Tim Curry's first memoir, Vagabond, with a very special screening of the cult classic film. This outrageous, genre-defying musical continues to thrill and delight audiences half a century on—and there’s no better way to experience it than on the big screen, surrounded by fellow fans.\\n\\nThis one-night event also excitingly marks the 50th anniversary of The Rocky Horror Picture Show. Tim Curry’s unforgettable performance as Dr. Frank-N-Furter cemented his place in cinema history, and his new memoir takes readers on a journey through his extraordinary life—from his early days on stage to his defining screen roles and beyond.\\n\\nWe look forward to welcoming you in your best Rocky Horror attire! Expect an evening of celebration, nostalgia, and sheer Rocky Horror joy as we honour both a cinematic milestone and one of the most iconic performers of our time. Whether you’re a seasoned fan or discovering the phenomenon for the first time, this promises to be an unmissable night of music, mischief, and memories.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Tim Curry\",\"Susan Sarandon\",\"Barry Bostwick\",\"Richard O'Brien\",\"Patricia Quinn\"],\"direction\":[\"Jim Sharman\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/91f4e6b10d2f1a08d29cf0827658409a.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/91f4e6b10d2f1a08d29cf0827658409a.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-10-16T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"Contains moderate sex and one use of strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"20th Century Studios\"}},{\"id\":\"326303\",\"title\":\"Roofman\",\"runtime\":7560,\"