},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13760\",\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants\",\"synopsis\":\"\",\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/d4277f1b7ade28cc855009f4bcf65a4a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"//cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3d463af87fbf989147fb3bfe4178c609.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Hoping to prove his bravery to Mr. Krabs, SpongeBob follows a mysterious, swashbuckling ghost pirate known as the Flying Dutchman on a seafaring adventure that takes him to the deepest depths of the ocean.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5e9730a3b4cd806e82681e9d9b6f9e03.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants\",\"synopsis\":\"Hoping to prove his bravery to Mr. Krabs, SpongeBob follows a mysterious, swashbuckling ghost pirate known as the Flying Dutchman on a seafaring adventure that takes him to the deepest depths of the ocean.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Tom Kenny\",\"Clancy Brown\",\"Rodger Bumpass\",\"Bill Fagerbakke\",\"Carolyn Lawrence\",\"Mark Hamill\",\"Regina Hall\",\"Sherry Cola\",\"Arturo Castro (XII)\",\"George Lopez\"],\"direction\":[\"Derek Drymon\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5e9730a3b4cd806e82681e9d9b6f9e03.jpg\",\"img/f7/9e/f79e7d9fd4dc4dc4aa06128b5fee3be8.jpg\",\"img/76/1a/761a7c86d4aa7e6dcb8b880ea0681e91.jpg\",\"img/81/a4/81a4055cc8b0d2f4bec8da38c9f5855c.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5e9730a3b4